{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The resistance distance between "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (Klein and Randić 1993): the effective"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resistance between them when each edge is a conductance (its weight; 1 without "},{"code":"weight:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e_s − e_t)ᵀ L⁺ (e_s − e_t). 0 when they are the same vertex, without reading any weight;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nil when they lie in different components. Symmetric. To read weights as resistances"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead, pass "},{"code":"{ 1 \/ r($0) }","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resistanceDistance"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text",