om 0, until the residual’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Euclidean norm is at most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":" (relative to the right-hand side, which has norm 1),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or, on a weight spread that puts that below rounding, until the true residual stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"improving. Jacobi preconditioned for 300 iterations, then by a modified incomplete Cholesky"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"factor in maximum-spanning-tree order. O((n + m) √κ) time; about 9 n words, and O(n + m) for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the factor when it is built."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" gives the conductance of the edge at each position, read once per position (every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position, also outside the component); a weight of 0 is no edge."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"target"},{"type":"text","text":" are vertices of the graph, every weight is finite and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nonnegative, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance > 0"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is at least 1."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NoConvergence"},{"type":"text","text":" after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" conjugate-gradient iterations (one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matrix–vector product each; 20,000 + 2n when nil), 